# Cloudflare Pages rewrite rules, copied into the bundle by the resources task.
#
# The pairing deep link is `<origin>/j#…` — a path with no file behind it. 200
# (rewrite, not redirect) serves index.html while the browser keeps the URL, which
# matters here more than usual: the whole pairing payload lives in the fragment, and
# a 301/302 is the one thing that would drop it.
/j  /index.html  200
